  "idea": "How to turn any website into a standalone desktop app on your computer",
  "text": "Keep your favorite daily web apps organized right on your computer taskbar for instant access. Leaving Slack, Notion, and Gmail buried behind browser tabs forces you to hunt across windows. Trapping daily tools inside browser tabs causes missed client messages and accidental window closures. Click your browser settings, select Install Site as App, and pin the new desktop shortcut. You separate daily work from browser clutter effortlessly.",
